      "content": "<div>\n<div itemprop=\"copy-paste-block\">See attached 3D file - are you able to create&nbsp;the shop drawings with this?\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>List below, bold are priority - renders attached for reference</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>- Armless Lounge Chair</b></div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>- Corner Chair</b></div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>- Ottoman</b></div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>- End of sofa/ Corner Side Table</b></div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>- Coffee Table</b></div>\n</blockquote>\n\n\n\n<blockquote>\n<div>- Single Chaise</div>\n</blockquote>\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div><attachment id=\"529f0eaa-bf9f-4a39-b80a-779c5fdf5f48\"></attachment><attachment id=\"3f67de9f-1341-47e0-aebf-48d5138f7925\"></attachment>"
